# Troubleshooting Scenarios

The following configuration problems were intentionally created and fixed during the lab:

- R1 G0/1 interface was shutdown
- R2 had OSPF area mismatch
- R2 LAN network was missing from OSPF
- R2 G0/2 used incorrect subnet mask
- PC2 had incorrect default gateway

