## Fixing R1 Interface Shutdown

The interface was enabled using the `no shutdown` command.

```bash
interface g0/1
no shutdown
```

![No Shutdown Fix](no-shutdown.png)

---

## Fixing OSPF Area Mismatch

R2 was configured with the wrong OSPF area.  
The network statement was corrected to Area 0.

```bash
router ospf 1
no network 10.0.12.0 0.0.0.3 area 1
network 10.0.12.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
network 192.168.2.0 0.0.0.255 area 0
```

![Area Mismatch Fix](area-mismatch.png)

